stasiya decides to take part in an unusual experiment to experience new emotions, fall in love and build a relationship. During the next few weeks she is going to communicate with the boys, who are willing to get to know her better. But first she has to choose from the guys that came on the audition based on their voice. Her mother Natalya and brother Anatoliy are there to help. Can the boys win over Nastya’s heart and the acceptance of her family?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cs7187r3HIuaiwLRlRwOWEgJRKw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-11\",\"runtime\":116},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"An intense first week awaits Nastya Ivleeva and the contenders for her heart. The boys have to  collect a bouquet of flowers for Nastya. The contestant with the most romantic gift will be able to take Nastya out on a date. The other guys are going to participate in an unusual photoshoot.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fJUKDiJ1UjbVbieXj4e1wtlfJcR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-18\",\"runtime\":140},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Nastya continues to chat and get to know the contestants. This episode Nastya is going on a rowdy date and later on a couples yoga. While another contestants are waiting for their personal dates with Nastya, they are going to share their ideas of the perfect date and learn how to do give massages. In the end of the week, they are throwing a mexican party.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2POAEU6g3vir3k3K4CZpM73aNBD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-25\",\"runtime\":89},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"This week two contestants are going to compete for a date with Nastya. Nastya’s mom is going to visit the other contestants in the house and  set up a meeting with a psychologist.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5QsaeNnXb1V3yJG6MVtN7m7o1Nm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-02\",\"runtime\":102},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Roman Kagramanov is organizing an auction, the prize is a date with Nastya. After the auction, the boys are going to test their construction skills and look into the future. Nastya is going on a double date in an old-Russian style. Who is going to leave the competition this week?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vBtp0jLsekjVZTthQCvth1g7RvL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-09\",\"runtime\":118},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"The contestants are traveling to an important place - Nastya’s hometown, Saint Petersburg. Here she is going to challenge them to cook their own shawerma. The winner of the challenge is going to take Nastya on a rooftop date. Nastya is going to have another date on a boat, while Roman is testing the boys on how well they know Nastya. What impression will this trip leave?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ajOpJ48sbUXCO6eNU2M4SnYO3zv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-16\",\"runtime\":85},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Nastya Ivleeva has already gotten to know a lot about the the contestants. Who does she want to try and build a new relationship with? Nastya is taking part in an experiment to find that out. She is going to see how her wedding with the remaining contestants would look like and spend a whole day in their possible life together. The boys are taking her on different dates: a rocker date, a home evening with friends and an acquaintance with the parents. Which day will Nastya want to repeat?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/neGoSmB8HXZgctoNYqqjUV8sH61.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-23\",\"runtime\":81},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The finalists of the show are announced. But Anastasiya hasn’t made her choice yet. Was she quick to eliminate one of the previous contestants? Nastya brings back one of the eliminated contestants to fix a potential mistake. Nastya is going out with each of the remaining three contestants on a date. Who of the contestants can convince Nastya that they have a future as a couple together?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kwzgcLaqkw2zBd7gI4bCFDdl3rt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-30\",\"runtime\":86}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-11-11\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}